WEBVTT

00:18.210 --> 00:19.740
'Course not!

00:38.130 --> 00:41.030
Umm... Takashi--

00:41.100 --> 00:44.230
What is it?

00:44.300 --> 00:46.070
I, um...

00:46.140 --> 00:49.230
Didn't you like the scarf
I gave you?

00:49.310 --> 00:50.500
It was okay.

01:04.060 --> 01:08.320
- What's wrong?
- I saw a guy who looks like Yota.

01:08.390 --> 01:10.160
Look, down there!!

01:24.210 --> 01:26.870
<i>Bring dreams to children.</i>

01:26.950 --> 01:30.940
<i>Enter the All-Japan</i>
<i>Picture Book Contest!</i>

01:32.090 --> 01:36.750
<i>If your book is filled with your love,</i>
<i>hope and drams, you could win!</i>

01:37.690 --> 01:41.060
<i>The winner will receive a prize</i>
<i>of one million yen!</i>

01:41.130 --> 01:45.570
<i>And children all over the country</i>
<i>will see your story!</i>

01:45.630 --> 01:51.800
<i>Send in your entries</i>
<i>to Nishikubo Publishing.</i>

01:51.870 --> 01:54.530
<i>We'll be waiting</i>
<i>for your picture book!</i>

02:17.660 --> 02:19.790
My time with Yota...

02:21.230 --> 02:23.640
is running out.

04:39.110 --> 04:41.900
- So.
- W-What?

04:41.970 --> 04:43.570
Say something.

04:43.640 --> 04:45.480
Okay...

04:45.550 --> 04:48.640
- Do I bore you?
- N-Not at all!

04:48.720 --> 04:51.810
I'm just...
a little nervous.

04:55.690 --> 04:58.390
- I'm outta here.
- Niimai!

05:17.780 --> 05:20.300
Niimai!

05:20.380 --> 05:22.350
I'm sorry.

05:22.420 --> 05:25.580
I thought you were trying
to leave me.

05:27.850 --> 05:30.550
Would it be okay
if we walked together?

05:30.620 --> 05:32.650
Yeah, sure.

05:46.740 --> 05:49.970
How about this one?

05:50.040 --> 05:53.170
Or maybe I oughtta try this one.

05:53.250 --> 05:57.810
If this one matched
the others-- Naah!

05:57.880 --> 06:00.150
Then how about... this one?

06:01.590 --> 06:04.420
Here's the Ai we know and love!

06:04.490 --> 06:06.650
It's cold!

06:06.730 --> 06:09.130
I hate this kinds of clothes.

06:11.660 --> 06:14.570
But I gotta.
It's to cheer Yota up!

06:17.470 --> 06:20.030
I think I remembered everything.

06:22.110 --> 06:24.200
Moteuchi!

06:26.210 --> 06:28.040
Moemi!

06:28.110 --> 06:29.740
Takashi!

06:34.220 --> 06:36.550
Aw, man!

06:39.790 --> 06:41.060
Moemi--

06:44.800 --> 06:46.990
- Here.
- Thanks.

06:47.930 --> 06:51.340
Moteuchi, got a sec?

06:51.400 --> 06:54.930
I am too nervous
alone with Takashi.

06:55.010 --> 06:58.170
Could you come with us?

06:59.250 --> 07:00.270
I--

07:00.350 --> 07:02.250
Please?

07:11.020 --> 07:15.520
- Niimai?
- We gotta catch our movie.

07:19.870 --> 07:23.100
<i>I gotta try to forget Moemi!</i>

07:25.400 --> 07:27.930
Yota!

07:32.380 --> 07:36.610
Yota, if it's bothering you,
try to take Moemi from me.

07:36.680 --> 07:37.840
Wha--?

07:39.190 --> 07:41.120
W-What's that supposed to mean?

07:43.490 --> 07:45.190
How--

07:46.990 --> 07:51.060
How could I ever do that!?

07:56.470 --> 07:58.730
Yota finally comes home...

07:58.800 --> 08:02.370
then he locks himself
in his dad's studio.

08:08.010 --> 08:09.850
Coffee's done!

08:09.920 --> 08:13.480
This'll stop all Yota's tears!

08:13.550 --> 08:15.990
Time for Ai to dry your eyes!

08:17.660 --> 08:19.630
Yota'll like this!

08:19.690 --> 08:23.460
With a skirt this short,
he'll catch a glimpse, no problem!

08:30.500 --> 08:32.270
Yota, here's your--

08:38.980 --> 08:41.110
Hey, Yota.

08:46.520 --> 08:47.780
Y-Yota.

08:49.890 --> 08:53.380
Yota!!
Get a grip!!

08:57.300 --> 08:59.890
That hurt!

08:59.970 --> 09:04.270
Sorry! I thought
you'd really gone bye-bye.

09:04.340 --> 09:08.140
Don't be dumb!
I was focusing my energies on drawing!

09:08.210 --> 09:11.800
Aren't you pushing yourself
too hard?

09:12.580 --> 09:14.440
That's good!

09:15.720 --> 09:19.480
- That's good!
- You drawing a picture book?

09:20.250 --> 09:22.740
You really get into it,
don'tcha?

09:22.820 --> 09:27.190
Especially since I heard about
the picture book contest.

09:27.260 --> 09:29.250
What?

09:29.330 --> 09:34.160
I will give the children
something to dream about.

09:34.230 --> 09:39.330
Then, with the power of art,
I'll give the world--

09:39.410 --> 09:42.000
Scratch that!
Give the entire universe...

09:42.070 --> 09:44.270
A goal to live for!

09:44.340 --> 09:48.040
A utopia that is founded
only on love.

09:48.110 --> 09:53.180
A Shangri-la that mankind has
searched for since the start!

09:53.250 --> 09:56.020
Born from my art!!

09:56.090 --> 10:00.120
This is the epitome of man!
The dream fills my very soul!

10:00.190 --> 10:02.860
I told ya not to push it.

10:02.930 --> 10:08.800
When you lose at love,
y'gotta chase your dreams.

10:09.670 --> 10:11.430
Yota--

10:12.970 --> 10:16.470
That's the spirit!
Keep up the good thoughts!

10:16.540 --> 10:18.070
Y'don't gotta hit me!

10:18.140 --> 10:22.550
It's great givin' the kids
a dream with your pictures!

10:22.620 --> 10:26.710
You gotta see this through,
no matter what!!

10:26.790 --> 10:28.380
Get offa me!!

10:29.220 --> 10:31.490
I'm serious, y'know!

10:31.560 --> 10:34.320
I know.

10:34.390 --> 10:38.300
Let's call this
"Good Point" the third.

10:38.360 --> 10:43.100
You were really down, but you
gave yourself a reason to go on.

10:43.170 --> 10:44.260
I'm impressed!

10:45.570 --> 10:46.730
Ai--

10:47.940 --> 10:52.070
I'm a video girl, but
I'm not doing much to help you.

10:52.140 --> 10:55.170
But I'll always
be behind you 100%.

10:56.080 --> 10:57.350
Ai!

11:06.690 --> 11:10.320
I've bothered you long enough.
I'll be out there.

11:10.400 --> 11:12.370
O-Okay.

11:13.370 --> 11:15.330
Ai!

11:15.400 --> 11:18.300
That outfit...
looks great on you.

11:20.770 --> 11:23.540
Now, Yota,
give it your best.

11:28.280 --> 11:32.050
<i>You say you can't do much.</i>

11:32.120 --> 11:36.180
<i>But when you tell me my good points,</i>
<i>you're saving my life.</i>

11:37.220 --> 11:40.750
<i>I've got Ai by my side.</i>

11:40.830 --> 11:44.020
And watch out, world!

11:49.900 --> 11:52.870
<i>What'll I do with Yota?</i>

11:56.740 --> 11:59.230
What's this?

12:03.950 --> 12:06.510
<i>Is my time up!?</i>
<i>It can't be!</i>

12:06.590 --> 12:08.450
Yota!

12:11.960 --> 12:16.050
Hey, Ai?
You okay out there?

12:16.130 --> 12:19.570
I-It's nothing!

12:25.700 --> 12:28.260
What was that all about?

12:30.080 --> 12:35.280
<i>Thank goodness.</i>
<i>I thought I'd never see him again.</i>

12:36.680 --> 12:38.210
<i>O-Oh, no!</i>

12:41.650 --> 12:45.020
<i>Somehow, I--</i>
<i>I've fallen--</i>

12:46.590 --> 12:48.360
<i>I've fallen for--</i>

12:52.030 --> 12:55.730
<i>But a video girl</i>
<i>can't fall in love!</i>

13:17.320 --> 13:18.920
Hey, Niimai.

13:18.990 --> 13:22.790
Wouldn't you say that Yota's
been acting strange lately?

13:22.860 --> 13:26.230
He's so cold to me.

13:26.300 --> 13:29.270
He doesn't even want
to talk to me anymore.

13:32.470 --> 13:38.570
How pretty! The perfect
Christmas present for a girl--

13:39.180 --> 13:40.310
Niimai!

13:42.080 --> 13:44.480
Niimai--

13:46.520 --> 13:48.540
Niimai! Wait!!

14:10.380 --> 14:13.280
Ai! Ai!

14:17.050 --> 14:18.710
Ai?

14:19.390 --> 14:22.010
You there?

14:23.520 --> 14:26.550
Whaddya want, Yota!?

14:31.200 --> 14:33.760
There's so many of 'em!

14:33.830 --> 14:36.830
Not bad for a week's
worth of work, huh?

14:36.900 --> 14:40.360
Just remember:
Quality over quantity.

14:40.440 --> 14:43.340
Well, duh!
I know that much!

14:43.410 --> 14:46.040
So, what'd you want?

14:46.980 --> 14:49.970
Oh, yeah.
I ran out of illustration board.

14:50.050 --> 14:52.350
I hate to ask you this,
but could you buy more for me?

14:52.420 --> 14:55.550
I'd go, but I'm in the middle
of drawing.

14:55.620 --> 14:58.850
Okay! No problem.
I'll go right now.

14:58.920 --> 15:02.550
Thank you!
And I...love you!

15:04.460 --> 15:07.260
Don't be a jerk, okay?

15:09.230 --> 15:12.230
Did I say something wrong?

15:32.060 --> 15:36.830
Remember when I said I loved you,
and you said you didn't?

15:41.200 --> 15:46.370
But then you changed your mind.
I was so happy.

15:51.310 --> 15:54.440
- Can I ask you a question?
- What?

15:59.320 --> 16:02.910
Honestly, do you like me?

16:08.930 --> 16:10.830
Can't you give me an answer?

16:18.770 --> 16:23.330
Sure I can, but first,
answer a question of mine.

16:23.410 --> 16:27.280
When we're together,
why do you only talk of Yota?

16:27.350 --> 16:30.810
You might not realize it
yourself...

16:30.880 --> 16:34.680
but I think that maybe
you're in love with him.

16:39.430 --> 16:40.620
It's fine with me.

16:42.730 --> 16:48.100
Just meet with Yota,
and search for your true feelings.

16:48.170 --> 16:50.430
That would be my answer.

16:57.540 --> 16:59.810
Thanks! Come again!

17:19.400 --> 17:20.730
Yota--

17:29.810 --> 17:32.970
What's taking her so long?

17:34.610 --> 17:35.640
'Kay.

17:55.500 --> 17:59.400
What am I trying to accomplish?

18:09.780 --> 18:12.650
Oh, I see. Thanks.

18:15.150 --> 18:18.350
So, where'd she go?
Maybe she got lost--

18:18.420 --> 18:22.520
Knowing her,
she probably got distracted.

18:35.570 --> 18:39.200
I gotta get these to Yota--

19:17.150 --> 19:18.670
Y-Yota.

19:26.530 --> 19:29.090
Moteuchi?

19:29.160 --> 19:30.530
Moemi--

19:34.300 --> 19:36.500
C-Could I talk to you
for a sec?

19:52.280 --> 19:53.780
Y-Yota.

20:12.040 --> 20:16.070
Am I gonna disappear this way?

20:16.140 --> 20:18.870
Never to see him again?

20:30.560 --> 20:31.960
Yota!

20:49.010 --> 20:53.000
- I was just with Niimai.
- With Takashi?

20:58.080 --> 21:02.650
Today's the first time
he was really considerate to me.

21:02.720 --> 21:07.590
I'm impressed! He usually
acts kinda mean to girls.

21:07.660 --> 21:09.220
He does? Really?

21:10.400 --> 21:11.990
I see.

21:18.570 --> 21:23.030
I don't think that Niimai
likes me very much.

21:24.310 --> 21:28.040
He told me to go meet you.

21:28.110 --> 21:33.480
He says that I'm really
in love with you.

21:46.700 --> 21:48.260
I-I don't believe it.

21:49.940 --> 21:52.730
And he was so gentle
when he said it.

21:52.800 --> 21:57.900
He was kind, but it was as if
it were his last kindness.

21:57.980 --> 22:00.240
And we'll be parted
from now on.

22:02.080 --> 22:07.780
And with that parting, I realized
something I didn't want to know.

22:13.460 --> 22:18.760
This person, who'll never love me,
I'll love the rest of my life.

22:25.600 --> 22:30.340
I'm sorry. I always bring
my depressing stories to you!

22:30.410 --> 22:32.430
Hang in there, Moemi!

22:43.820 --> 22:50.290
<i>This person, who'll never love me,</i>
<i>I'll love the rest of my life.</i>

22:53.900 --> 22:56.700
<i>It's hard, but I knew it already.</i>

22:57.940 --> 23:01.630
<i>But I--</i>
<i>But I have--</i>

23:03.310 --> 23:04.710
<i>I have Ai!</i>

23:04.780 --> 23:08.180
<i>And she'll be waiting</i>
<i>when I get home!</i>

23:15.620 --> 23:18.350
Why aren't the lights on?

23:20.960 --> 23:22.220
Ai! I'm home!

23:23.260 --> 23:25.590
Ai!? You here!?
Ai! Ai!

23:25.660 --> 23:27.570
Ai! Where are you--!?

23:30.940 --> 23:34.840
T-This means--
She can't!

23:34.910 --> 23:36.740
Ai can't be--!

23:42.250 --> 23:45.240
Ai's in trouble!

23:49.420 --> 23:55.330
You're recalling the tape?
She still has time--

23:55.390 --> 23:59.800
We can't recall the tape
from Yota Moteuchi so soon--

23:59.870 --> 24:04.000
It must be recalled.
Ai is defective.

24:04.070 --> 24:08.270
We could leave Ai with Moteuchi,
but she would not aid him.

24:08.340 --> 24:14.750
I respectfully disagree.
Moteuchi needs Ai.

24:16.010 --> 24:19.420
Ai! Where did you go! Ai!

24:20.220 --> 24:22.620
Ai!

24:22.690 --> 24:27.750
Before you recall her,
please ask Ai how she feels.

24:27.830 --> 24:29.090
Please!

24:29.160 --> 24:31.430
I decide her fate.

24:32.660 --> 24:35.330
I am her creator.

24:36.370 --> 24:38.000
Ai! Where are you!?

24:38.070 --> 24:40.970
Ai! Ai!

24:49.150 --> 24:53.410
Where can she be!?
Ai! Ai!

27:06.820 --> 27:07.950
Answer me, Ai!

27:10.890 --> 27:13.380
Ai is disappearing!

27:17.660 --> 27:19.260
Take me, Moteuchi!

27:20.370 --> 27:21.460
M-Moemi!

27:27.710 --> 27:32.080
Do you see how fragile
this love is?

27:34.580 --> 27:37.010
- Ai!
- Yota!

27:37.080 --> 27:42.250
I'm sorry! Forgive me!
And forget about me!

27:42.320 --> 27:43.480
Go away!

27:45.060 --> 27:51.090
Don't worry! If I disappear
I won't regret any of it!

27:51.160 --> 27:57.400
It was just for a moment,
but I know what it means to love!
